// Factory Matrix FM patches — Sytrus/DX7-style showcase patches that exercise the engine's depth
// (multi-operator FM/RM, per-op ADSR, lp/hp filters with cutoff-sweep envelopes). One source of truth:
// `matrixFmPatches()` is the raw {id,name,category,lines} list the MatrixFmPanel patch-picker loads;
// `matrixFmFactoryInstrumentPresets()` wraps the same data as instrument presets seeded into a project.

